---
title: "agy acp channel session: one terminal post per person input"
---
stateDiagram-v2
  state "Legend" as legend {
    lg0: Process
    lg1: Turn
    lg2: Session
    lg3: Breaks PostOnlyWithDisposition
    lg4: Breaks AnswerCoversWholeSteer or AtMostOnePost in some cases
    lg5: Path to the AnswerCoversWholeSteer or AtMostOnePost or PostOnlyWithDisposition bug
  }
  class lg0 tan
  class lg1 blue
  class lg2 teal
  class lg3 breaks
  class lg4 mayBreak
  class lg5 bugPath
  s0: No agy child
  s1: Child up, no session
  s2: Session idle
  s3: Prompt open
  s4: Turn steered: two prompts open
  s5: Rejected steer held by Returning record
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s0: a person sends a message
  s0 --> s1: AgentDesk starts agy acp
  s1 --> s2: session/new
  s2 --> s3: session/prompt for the next input (new turn, or steer while a prompt is open)
  s3 --> s4: session/prompt for the next input (new turn, or steer while a prompt is open)
  s4 --> s3: agy answers the prompt (stopReason)
  s3 --> s3: writer posts the turn's one terminal message (covers steered inputs)
  s3 --> s5: steer prompt rejected before execution
  s5 --> s1: person runs /clear (a steer being returned is discarded too)
  classDef breaks fill:#ffecee,stroke:#e72e3b,stroke-width:2.5px,color:#cd2834
  classDef mayBreak fill:#fff3e6,stroke:#e8730c,stroke-width:2.5px,color:#b85a06
  class s0 tan
  class s0 bugPath
  class s1 teal
  class s1 mayBreak
  class s1 bugPath
  class s2 teal
  class s2 bugPath
  class s3 blue
  class s3 mayBreak
  class s3 bugPath
  class s4 blue
  class s4 bugPath
  class s5 teal
  class s5 breaks
  class s5 bugPath
